Q: Write A simple java Program to demonstrate Class and Object
package classobject_cardetails;

//Class defination (blueprint)
class Car{
    //Attributes or Properties of Car
    String brand;
    String color;
    int year;
    
    //Method (behaviour)
    public void displayDetails(){
        System.out.println("Brand: " + brand);
        System.out.println("Color: " + color);
        System.out.println("Year: " + year);
        
    }
}
public class ClassObject_CarDetails {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        //Creating an object of Car
        Car myCar = new Car();
        
        //Assigning Values to object Attributes
        myCar.brand="Toyota";
        myCar.color="Red";
        myCar.year=2022;
        
        //Calling method on the object
        myCar.displayDetails();
    }
    
}

OUTPUT:
Brand: Toyota
Color: Red
Year: 2022

